# African Drumming Workshops with Bassidi Kone

Bassidi returns and heats up the Sunshine Coast & Brisbane with African drumming workshops and show! We are very excited to announce that Bassidi Kone from Mali will be returning to the Sunshine Coast for an exciting weekend of African Drumming action in July.  There will be African Drumming workshops offered in both the Sunshine Coast and Brisbane and an African performance that you absolutely cannot miss right here on the Sunshine Coast. We are doing a call out to all dancers, drummers and groovers to pop this event into your diary immediately! Bassidi Kone has just released a 14track album with his group [Bwazan](http://http://www.groupbwazan.com/Group_Bwazan/Welcome_1.html).  Cd's will be available at all events over this weekend. To keep updated on Bwazan follow their [Facebook page](http://https://www.facebook.com/Bwazan?fref=ts). Check out this [performance](http://http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RT3AGkerUpI) and many others on Youtube to get a taste of what your in for! Pop these dates in your diary.

## July 12th - African Performance @ Cafe Le Monde, Noosa.

## July 13th - African Drumming Intensive @ Palmwoods, Sunshine Coast.

## July 14th - African Drumming Intensive @ BEMAC  Brisbane.

Ph 0434585992 for bookings and more info. NEW and updated details will be regularly posted to our [Facebook page.](http://https://www.facebook.com/RhythmCultureOZ)
